    "description": "One-call summary of the user's finances: net worth, assets, liabilities, cash, investments, pensions, debts and (when a budget exists) monthly surplus and emergency runway. Built only from recorded accounts and budget entries; anything not recorded is null and listed in missing[] with a question to ask the user. Pass asOfMonth (YYYY-MM) for balances as at the end of a past month, from recorded monthly history (budget figures are then null, as the budget is not kept by month). Start here before drilling into other tools.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
