    "description": "Lists the user's accounts with a short opaque id, a label, category and balance. Liabilities show the amount owed as a positive number with isLiability true. Mortgages add the remaining term and fixed-rate end date, and pensions the monthly contribution, when stored (null when not). Institution names are replaced with generic labels unless the token has full read access.",
