    "description": "Deprecated: first tool to be removed from this server. Sets the interest saved by overpaying a recorded mortgage by a fixed monthly amount beside the growth on the same amount invested at an expected annual return. Reads the mortgage balance, interest rate and remaining term from the mortgage account; anything not recorded is listed in missing[] and the comparison is left null rather than guessed. The expected return is required and is a single constant rate. The result states both outcomes and their difference; it does not choose between them.",
    "execution": {
      "taskSupport": "forbidden",
    },
